  "unmapped_findings": [
    "Alloys with Al additions of 4 wt.% and 6 wt.% are only very weakly affected by the applied aging treatments in terms of their mechanical data, compared with Fe-30Mn-1.2C (weakening/embrittlement) and Fe-30Mn-1.2C-8Al (strengthening). [b0024]",
    "The intermediate alloy variants with Al concentrations of 2–6 wt.% do not show equivalent mechanical properties compared to the ~8 wt.% Al variant, and a much smaller influence of aging on the tensile behavior is observed in the 2–6 wt.% Al cases. [b0025]"
  ]
